  "description": "YITAMOTOR fender flares provide a customized off-road look and add significant tire coverage to prevent dust and debris.\nFitment\n2019-2024 Chevy Silverado 1500(NOT FIT FOR 2019 LD)\nFeatures\nPERFECT FIT - YITAMOTOR fender flares are compatible with 2019-2024 Chevrolet Silverado 1500. Each Fender Flare is designed for a specific model, so please confirm your vehicle's year, make, and model\nFULL PROTECTION - With wide coverage, YITAMOTOR fender flares can fully protect your car, and block mud, scratches, and sand, which makes you drive on muddy roads with peace of mind\nHIGH QUALITY - Made of easy-to-clean PP material, these high-quality wheel flares are flexible, durable, impact-resistant, rust-resistant, and 100% UV-resistant to protect your truck\nPAINTABLE - Providing your truck with off-road style, making your truck stand out on the road, and you can freely DIY these smooth matte black fender flares as you like\nEASY TO INSTALL - The injection molding technology can ensure that the hole position of the fender flares fits, and makes each part reach a uniform thickness, professional installation is strongly recommended",
